[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 1152.87, "timestamp": "00:19:12", "text": "好了，我回來了。我回來了。我回來了。非常非常"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1155.909, "timestamp": "00:19:15", "text": "抱歉。 [笑聲]"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1157.909, "timestamp": "00:19:17", "text": "我的天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1161.029, "timestamp": "00:19:21", "text": "好吧，我沒想到會這樣。 [笑聲] 我的天哪，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1163.19, "timestamp": "00:19:23", "text": "我真沒想到。我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1165.51, "timestamp": "00:19:25", "text": "本來想做點"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1167.868, "timestamp": "00:19:27", "text": "別的事，結果沒想到（嗤笑"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1168.709, "timestamp": "00:19:28", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "welcome back"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1171.798, "timestamp": "00:19:31", "text": "）送貨員打電話來了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1173.19, "timestamp": "00:19:33", "text": "[笑聲]我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1175.99, "timestamp": "00:19:35", "text": "天哪。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1179.83, "timestamp": "00:19:39", "text": "感謝您的耐心等待。我很抱歉。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1182.39, "timestamp": "00:19:42", "text": "我甚至連文本來源都沒有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1185.51, "timestamp": "00:19:45", "text": "我當時有嗎？好的。呃，這是什麼"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1189.19, "timestamp": "00:19:49", "text": "？哦，是的。我馬上回來。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1191.75, "timestamp": "00:19:51", "text": "嗯，是的"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 1193.806, "timestamp": "00:19:53", "author": "@Surya_VT", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/xYZGMsDSkF4w1IOdT2xKmMHI-M3-NParGStQvKERjxxwivecaInz95y5n8jliQSZ7SgMMYzdrw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "UCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hf90Xv-jHeOR8gSxxrToBAUCkszU2WH9gy1mb0dV-11UJg/hf90Xv-jHeOR8gSxxrToBA"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 1193.99, "timestamp": "00:19:53", "text": "，我剛才說了句「馬上回來」。哦，是的。  是的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "